# Protect artifact byte-integrity for the Meylux V2 evidence model.
#
# The project's evidence chain cites exact Blob SHAs (see ADR-GOVERNANCE-013 Rule 3
# and docs/verification/GATE_DEFINITIONS.md section 4). Git for Windows sets
# core.autocrlf=true system-wide, so without this file an ordinary Windows checkout
# materializes CRLF in the working tree while every canonical blob is LF, and a
# local file no longer matches the SHA it is compared against.
#
# '* -text' disables all line-ending conversion, so a checkout on any platform
# reproduces the stored bytes exactly.
#
# This file is additive. It does not rewrite, re-normalize, or re-commit any
# existing artifact.
* -text
